<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-14T00:30:27.221Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 00:30:27 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits killed four soldiers and 18 others in Zamfara, while gunmen killed 24 people in another Nigerian attack, and a separate ambush in Zamfara left 20 dead including soldiers. ISWAP fighters attacked a military base in Adamawa and were repelled, and a Nigerian air strike in Borno killed about 40 ISWAP fighters and a top Lakurawa militant. Atiku Abubakar publicly urged security agencies to rescue an abducted family in Kaduna. The Senate began probing NAF aircraft maintenance after a crash killed 25 in Ondo. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTE1HU3RuWFppRXNtbmRBUjFfSTEtOHZuemp2Z2V3aGdvY1A2U2pKMk8xOERPWGdWNWFuRk45Z2xUcUI5eGxBc2FsMDZTbFQtZldTTmdlNGp6MnhfemhVRHFlNktPclNNcVNGbDVlZjM0aTd2NlZZSzRsT2VRRy1Kdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQczFfSFRPOG5EYXJNQTVMa0p2T0JRMXRXS0Npak1lS0x3RkRXVW1IS0xxZGpQQm9Fb1o4WlZwTWYxZmcyTUpOZnRRN05UWlBlMjY1elM0RHYzcUR4WkRuSFJtSkxVZkxBTmt4cDZoYlNtaGlPR1lZQTRTN1dWMTN3TElYenBPT0Jac3M5MVdZa0tPNlVrZ0t6NVUtZEpNQm_SAaYBQVVfeXFMTThsc2tsczlCTG1VX2ZpbW4yNXFMVFktU21lRUNsaDlNWHhOVGZTRVdJOS1faml2M2tkbS1tcnlsVUM4c2xLMDdsbVYyWVFiUWRyUG5PZGhESEtHbGFKaUl2UEV4QmdDd0NwRGsweGFzZWZCRElnNnh3OEs0bzN5bU45a2JFWmJSZHVUWDdjZVM5ZW12SDNFVzNaMWtwclp2bUN3WXl0UQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxQeS1oN0xNcXNQVDVoVExBNUpRVzViU1YxY2xIaEwzMmxuTHFpQUZZZGJNM1Y2NWE3Xzc1MHVpRmJ2Y1p4VFNGd0lsem10S2JCWWFLaEs0NGdoN0U2SlBpR3FMbUNNUl8zRjVyaUZFS1dVWGJFT3R5OUQ2OWdmYXIxX3VreHdod2dYNWlJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTE9YWkhJVTJLTGQ2Qy1iOElxai04UG5aUU01S0c3ak1KV2RVcDBEQ2hTWTRVdVVu